# Genesis admin — environment template.
# Copy to .env.local (or .env) for local development. Never commit real values.
# Production: Vercel → admin project → Settings → Environment Variables,
# for Production and Preview. NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are built into the site's
# JavaScript at build time: after changing one, redeploy.
# Only public values belong here. The admin signs in with email and password
# against the backend; it needs no Google, Razorpay or Cloudinary keys.

# Required. Backend origin plus /api; the app adds /v1.
# Live: https://genesis-backend-ajbs.onrender.com/api
# There is no default: the app refuses to start or build without a valid URL,
# and a Vercel build refuses anything that isn't a public https address.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# Optional. Storefront address for "View Storefront" and the Story preview link.
# Defaults to the live site, https://genesisbypreethy.com (never localhost).
# Set it locally to preview against a local storefront.
NEXT_PUBLIC_STOREFRONT_URL=http://localhost:3000
